</h1>

<p class="lead text-center mb-4">
    Your complete free guide to learning C# programming. From fundamentals to professional development,
    with .NET, ASP.NET Core, SQL Server, MAUI, and more.
</p>

<div class="text-center mb-5">
    <a href="/GettingStarted" class="btn btn-primary-custom me-2">
        <i class="fas fa-rocket me-2"></i>Start Learning
    </a>
    <a href="/CSharpFundamentals" class="btn btn-outline-primary">
        <i class="fas fa-book me-2"></i>Browse Lessons
    </a>
</div>

<div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <div class="feature-box text-center">
            <div class="number">14+</div>
            <div class="text-muted">Topics Covered</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <div class="feature-box text-center">
            <div class="number">100+</div>
            <div class="text-muted">Lessons</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <div class="feature-box text-center">
            <div class="number">100%</div>
            <div class="text-muted">Free Access</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
        <div class="feature-box text-center">
            <div class="number">24/7</div>
